<title>POLAND: AGA Polish unit issues PLN 40 mln CPs.</title>
<headline>AGA Polish unit issues PLN 40 mln CPs.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of Swedish industrial gas firm AGA,  Aga Gaz Sp zoo, issued 40 million zlotys of one-month commercial paper with a yield of 18.6 percent, the issue agent ING Bank NV in Warsaw said.</p>
<p>It said in a Thursday statement that the tranche was part of the company's 40 million zloty borrowing programme launched in February 1995.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
